  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "Given equation: 165 – 15 ÷ 5 + 6 × 16 = 102.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) - and +\n\nGiven: 165 – 15 ÷ 5 + 6 × 16 = 102\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 165 + __**15 ÷ 5**__ - 6 × 16 = 102\n\n⇒ 165 + 3 - __**6 × 16**__ = 102\n\n⇒ __**165 + 3**__ - 96 = 102\n\n⇒ __**168 - 96**__ = 102\n\n⇒ 72 ≠ 102\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) + and ×\n\nGiven: 165 – 15 ÷ 5 + 6 × 16 = 102\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 165 – __**15 ÷ 5**__ × 6 + 16 = 102\n\n⇒ 165 – __**3 × 6**__ + 16 = 102\n\n⇒ __**165**__ – 18 __**+ 16**__ = 102\n\n⇒ __181** – 18**__ = 102\n\n⇒ 163 ≠ 102\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) + and ÷\n\nGiven: 165 – 15 ÷ 5 + 6 × 16 = 102\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 165 – 15 + __**5 ÷ 6**__ × 16 = 102\n\n⇒ 165 – 15 + __**0.83 × 16**__ = 102\n\n⇒ __**165**__ – 15 __**+ **____13.28__ = 102\n\n⇒ __178.28____ - 15__ = 102\n\n⇒ 163.28 ≠ 102\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 4) ÷ and –**\n\nGiven: 165 – 15 ÷ 5 + 6 × 16 = 102\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**165 ÷ 15**__ - 5 + 6 × 16 = 102\n\n⇒ 11 - 5 + __**6 × 16**__ = 102\n\n⇒ __**11**__ - 5 __**+ 96**__ = 102\n\n⇒ __107 - 5__ = 102\n\n⇒ 102 = 102\n\n⇒ **LHS = RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 4\".",
